# Oceanic Federation

## Classification

Federal Multinational State

## Abbreviation

OF

## Founded

2044

## Capital

Singapore

## Overview

The Oceanic Federation (OF) is a multinational federal state founded under the Singapore Treaty in 2044.

Created during the global instability of the mid-21st century, the Federation was formed to provide economic, political and military stability throughout Oceania and Southeast Asia as climate change, economic collapse and geopolitical fragmentation accelerated worldwide.

By 2061 the Federation has become one of the world's major powers and the principal military opponent of the Empire of the Cleansing Light.

